WEBVTT

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.900
My name is Ichijou Hotaru.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.950
I'm in the fifth grade.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.300
This spring, I transferred to 
this little branch school.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.340
U-Um... I'm Ichijou Hotaru.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.160
I moved here from Tokyo.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:40.680
Ichijou
Hotaru

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:37.950
Wow! From Tokyo?!

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.420
That says "Hotaru?"

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:40.680
I never saw that character before.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:41.800
What grade?

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.390
Oh, fifth.

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:45.570
Younger? She's younger than me?!

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:48.030
She doesn't look like a fifth grader.

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:51.280
Did you get into trouble at your old school?

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.960
No, it's because of my dad's work.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:56.020
Oh, well, that sounds normal.

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:01.450
Meowning!

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:05.430
M-Meow...

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:39.470
<b>Episode 2</b>

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:39.470
<b>We Went to Look at the Stars</b>

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:45.300
Before I knew it, it had been a few 
days since I transferred here.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.740
It's different from my old 
school in lots of ways.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:51.980
<b>Grade 8 Class 1</b>

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:51.980
<b>+ Grade 1 
+ Grade 7 
+ Grade 9 
+ Grade 5</b>

00:02:49.740 --> 00:02:51.980
Every day is full of surprises.

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:56.860
Also in my class are Komari-senpai, 
in eighth grade,

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.770
Natsumi-senpai, in seventh grade,

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:00.610
and Renge-chan, in first grade.

00:03:01.130 --> 00:03:04.910
And there's also Komari-senpai and 
Natsumi-senpai's older brother.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.490
Hey, Hotarun!

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:09.570
Wanna play knock-down-the-ruler?

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:11.400
Huh? Knock-down-the-ruler?

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:13.150
What's that?

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:14.840
It's a game we play with rulers.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:19.940
Um... I have no idea how to play, 
but if that's all right...

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:22.930
Sure, that's okay. Bring your ruler and pen.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:24.720
Here they are.

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:27.210
Okay, I'll explain it as we play.

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:30.350
I played it at Nattsun's 
house, so I'll explain, too.

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:32.410
Try to hit your opponent's ruler.

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.440
If you knock it off the desk, you win.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.710
Got it.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:38.190
Okay, you can go first.

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:39.120
Okay.

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:43.280
Go!

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:47.160
Sorry! It landed on top of it!

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.870
No, that's fine.

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:51.540
When you've pinned your opponent's ruler,

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:55.420
they have to break it free 
in three hits, or they lose.

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:58.060
Three hits

00:03:56.050 --> 00:04:00.680
In this case, your ruler 
is on top of Ren-chon's,

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:01.060
If she frees it, she's safe

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:04.720
so if Ren-chon can't get it 
free in three hits, she loses.

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:04.720
If she can't free it, she's out

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.180
Oh, I see. Good.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:12.520
Hotarun, it's too early to 
start thinking you've won.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.090
Look closely.

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:17.280
Do you notice anything about 
the way I put my ruler down?

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:19.230
Huh? How you put it down?

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:21.260
It just looks normal...

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:26.070
Do you mean how the side with the 
thinning edge is facing down?

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:27.580
That's right!

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:31.910
And I'll show you the 
purpose of that right now!

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:37.670
It's the Waterfall Climb!

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.690
Huh? Waterfall Climb?

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:43.990
It's when you hit the thin part of your 
ruler with the pen to make it jump!

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.580
Hika-nee named it a few years back.

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:48.600
Oh, it's the name of a move?

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.820
You can use it to break 
free from being pinned

00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:53.430
or to make your ruler pin 
down someone else's!

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:55.570
Okay, I'm next.

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:56.390
There!

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.110
Aww, almost.

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:02.220
Ren-chon, your only hope now 
is a Swallow Reversal.

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:05.260
I know! I'll do a Swallow Reversal!

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:07.110
Um, what's a Swallow Reversal?

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:11.520
A Swallow Reversal is when part of 
your ruler is hanging off the desk,

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:15.080
and you use your pen to push it up 
and onto another player's ruler.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.540
You do this... like that.

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:19.550
It's a counterattack!

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:22.200
Well, I broke free.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.590
I failed to defeat Koma-chan.

00:05:24.900 --> 00:05:27.340
Hey! Don't call me Koma-chan!

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.800
They call you Koma-chan, Senpai?

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.650
She called me Senpai!

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:34.200
Huh?

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:37.500
Natsumi and Renge never 
treat me like a senpai.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:38.770
It's new to me!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:43.690
It's new for me to have middle 
school students in my class, too!

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:48.030
Sorry to interrupt your fun, you two,

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:51.900
but I customized my ruler 
just for today's event.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:55.090
I coated both sides of my ruler with wax!

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:59.170
It reduces friction and makes 
more advanced strikes possible!

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:03.080
I think I'll use it to knock 
Nee-chan out of the game.

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:04.630
That could be trouble, Senpai!

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:07.860
B-But that makes it slippery, 
so it'll bring about its own defeat!

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:08.790
I'll be fine!

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:13.310
You won't be able to talk like that for long.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.980
Now, Nee-chan, prepare yourself!

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:20.380
Whoa, that was close! It shot right over!

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:21.750
Did I put too much wax on?

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:25.070
See? I told you it would 
bring about its own defeat!

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:28.210
That's what you get for 
modifying your own ruler.

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:30.800
Hotaru, knock Natsumi's ruler off.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.530
O-Okay.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:36.580
All right, I guess this is a good 
time to start planning my victory.

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:38.710
You'd better get ready too, Renge.

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:43.750
It's my turn next, I'll get you 
back for that Swallow Reversal.

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:45.930
Okay, my turn...

00:06:46.940 --> 00:06:49.090
Huh? Where's my ruler?

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:51.760
S-Sorry! My hand slipped!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.760
Wanna play knock-down-the-ruler 
with us, Nii-chan?

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:59.230
Nee-chan lost, so you can 
jump in from her spot.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:02.690
All right, go ahead and start.

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:08.650
Whoa! He attacked all three 
of us in one strike?!

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:10.400
Crap! Nii-chan's good!

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:14.360
Ren-chon, we'll all have to work 
together, or we'll never win!

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:16.720
Go straight for the knock-off 
with your next attack!

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:17.870
O-Okay!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.970
All right! You knocked off his rul—

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.800
Th-The Last-Second Grab!

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:32.390
Last-Second Grab?

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:36.040
It's when you flip your ruler with 
your pen before it hits the floor,

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:38.780
and get it back on the 
desk to stay in the game!

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:40.810
It's a highly advanced move.

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:43.190
When did you move over here, anyway?

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:46.190
For now, I'll return mine to 
the center to keep it safe.

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:47.640
Good luck.

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:48.440
Go!

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:52.810
That was close!

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:55.270
And after I got it back to the safe zone...

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:56.240
Nattsun.

00:07:56.510 --> 00:08:01.370
To beat Nii-nii, I'm going 
to wager everything on you.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:02.880
Huh? What do you mean?

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:05.540
Watch and you'll see!

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.940
Huh? It's fine that you 
did a Waterfall Climb,

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:13.550
but it landed on Natsumi's ruler.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:14.800
Was that a mistake?

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:18.310
I get it, Ren-chon!

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:21.540
Now I do a Swallow Reversal with 
Ren-chon's ruler still on mine,

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:24.770
and Nii-chan's ruler is 
pinned under both of ours!

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:32.750
They were both on top of it, 
and he got it out easily!

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:34.910
No, it's okay. This is right.

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:38.990
I just did that so Nii-chan would have 
no choice but to escape to the edge.

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:40.620
It's my turn next.

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:42.980
Now I'll gently tap them together...

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:45.650
Huh? Why didn't you try to knock it off?

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:46.920
I can't knock it off now.

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:50.670
Just look. Nii-chan's in position 
to do another Last-Second Grab.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:52.450
Okay, Hotarun!

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:54.180
Hit it from there as hard as you can,

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:58.150
and knock off my ruler and 
Ren-chon's along with Nii-chan's!

00:08:58.150 --> 00:08:59.430
What? Are you sure?

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.930
There's no other way to beat Nii-chan!

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:05.440
O-Okay...

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:14.900
Go!

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:19.330
Natsumi's ruler slid over Nii-chan's 
ruler and flew off the desk!

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:22.740
Yes! My ruler is coated with wax!

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:27.170
And while Nii-chan is distracted 
by my ruler flying past him,

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:34.750
Ren-chon's ruler destroys 
his in a suicide attack!

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:38.140
It's a move that took all 
three of us working together:

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.630
the Last-Second Grab Blocker!

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:54.860
All right! We worked together 
and beat Nii-chan!

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:58.220
So, what'd you think of 
knock-down-the-ruler, Hotarun?

00:09:58.220 --> 00:09:59.920
It was fun!

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:02.050
Can we play it again?

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:05.330
I want to see how well I can 
do on my own this time!

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:08.170
Okay!

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:10.640
We're gonna play one more round!

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:12.230
Yeah!

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:14.300
I'm gonna win this time!

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:18.780
You guys, break time ended ages ago.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:29.450
I never thought a game using just pens 
and rulers would be so exciting.

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:31.440
There's Eraser Flick, too.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:32.520
Eraser Flick?

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:36.240
You flick an eraser with your finger 
to knock down an opponent's eraser.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.930
And we play baseball with 
pens and erasers, too.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:40.550
We've played golf, too.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:41.880
Golf?

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:42.410
Oh, right.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.650
Par 4

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.660
This is the golf course.

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:47.850
I'd love to try golf!

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:48.890
I'll lend you this.

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:50.690
Let's all go play after the weekend.

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:53.650
Thank you! I'll go and practice!

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:56.880
It's fun to learn so many new 
games I didn't know of before.

00:10:57.410 --> 00:11:01.300
I've experienced so many new 
things since I moved here.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.810
That's great.

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:05.500
Hey, want to go look at the stars sometime?

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:07.750
There's a hill with a great view of the stars.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:09.070
I'd love to go!

00:11:09.070 --> 00:11:10.660
Maybe I'll go with you.

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:11.910
I'll go, too!

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:13.520
Then how about this Saturday?

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:15.130
That'll be fine!

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:27.510
Pechi, let's go for a walk.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.540
Okay, okay. Don't get so hyper.

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:32.080
Ready to go?

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:37.720
Oh, right. I could go return 
Senpai's notebook, too.

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:39.550
I played some golf yesterday.

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:45.070
It's so nice out.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:47.280
I hope this will give us 
a good view of the stars.

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.290
I've never gone this way before.

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:55.320
Okay, Pechi, let's check it out.

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:16.580
Pechi.

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:19.230
Ready to head back now?

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:21.480
Let's see...

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:25.140
Huh? Which way did we come from?

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:28.100
I think we took the middle path.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:31.450
Well, if that's wrong, we can 
always just come back here.

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:42.400
Huh? Is this where we just were?

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:46.020
W-Well, if we're back where we started,

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:48.990
that means we should take 
the left path, right?

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:00.040
<i>That's weird...</i>

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:03.100
<i>Was there a river when 
we came by here before?</i>

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:04.970
<i>I'm totally lost.</i>

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.100
<b>Shopping Center</b>

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.100
<b>Straight Ahead</b>

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:16.230
Where... am I?

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:20.330
Wh-Wh-What do I do?

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:22.860
I have no idea where to go!

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:26.540
I don't even see anyone I 
can ask for directions!

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:29.740
I wanna go home!

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.330
Someone come find me!

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.850
Komari-senpai!

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:38.130
Senpai...

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:41.170
Pechi, that's Komari-senpai's...

00:13:42.190 --> 00:13:43.920
What is it? Pechi—

00:13:44.860 --> 00:13:47.530
Pechi, where are you going? Pechi!

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:49.910
Come back! This is dangerous!

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:51.510
Pechi!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:57.020
Pechi!

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:10.120
Pechi!

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:20.430
I just go straight down this road?

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.340
Thank you so much.

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:28.900
I finally made it home.

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:32.720
<i>Oh, yeah.</i>

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:34.960
<i>We're going to see the stars tonight,</i>

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:37.220
<i>so I could have returned her notebook then.</i>

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.940
Go straight there and back. 
Don't stop anywhere.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:44.340
Okay.

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:47.300
We're just going to see the 
stars, so we won't be out long.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:50.980
Hotaru-chan, make sure Komari 
doesn't make any side trips.

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:52.200
O-Okay.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.260
Jeez, and I'm the older one...

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:57.750
All right, go on. Be careful.

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:00.260
Um, is Natsumi-senpai coming?

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:02.560
Natsumi fell asleep after dinner.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:05.530
And Renge can't come because 
her grandma's visiting.

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:07.160
I see.

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:09.280
It's still okay if it's just us two, right?

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:09.970
Sure!

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:13.530
Oh, yeah. Nii-chan brought me my notebook.

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:15.310
Oh, I appreciate that.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.160
Oh, did you bring a flashlight?

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.640
Huh? No...

00:15:21.640 --> 00:15:23.850
I've got one, so I guess we'll be fine.

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:25.610
Oh, I'll carry it.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:26.640
Thanks.

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:29.850
Is this the right way?

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:32.820
I got lost earlier today.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.620
What? You did?

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:37.540
But you're with me this 
time, so you'll be fine.

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:38.460
Yeah!

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:41.400
Did you bring money?

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.000
Yes.

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:43.960
Let's buy some drinks, then.

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:46.880
Doesn't buying drinks at night 
make you feel like a grown-up?

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:47.840
Yeah.

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:54.230
Yeah, of course...

00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:58.170
It's normal for a vending machine 
to be a bug paradise at night.

00:15:58.170 --> 00:15:59.550
That's normal?

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:02.270
I-I'm getting orange juice.

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:09.610
Is something wrong?

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:15.130
Oh, no, just... Doesn't it seem like 
there'd be bugs or frogs in here?

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:22.120
Something's in there! 
Something wet and cold!

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:25.130
It's not your juice?

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:32.800
It was your juice.

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:38.640
This juice is good.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.770
I'm glad there were no bugs on it.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:45.360
Uh... Don't tell my mom 
we bought drinks, okay?

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:47.990
If she finds out I was snacking 
at night, I'll get in trouble.

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:48.980
Okay.

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:53.660
Is something wrong?

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:56.070
I dropped the lid from my bottle.

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.510
Huh? I don't see it...

00:16:58.510 --> 00:16:59.900
It'll be litter...

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:01.580
Want me to help you look?

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:04.640
Well, we can't take too much time.

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:06.990
Maybe we should look for 
it again on the way back.

00:17:06.990 --> 00:17:07.840
Okay.

00:17:12.350 --> 00:17:14.750
Is the hill still a long way from here?

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:17.680
There are no lights left out here anymore...

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.130
It's kinda sca—

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:19.820
Huh?

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:21.520
Not scary at all!

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:24.590
We should be there soon.

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:25.640
Okay.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.960
We're finally here.

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:31.620
Oh, don't try to run off with 
the flashlight in your hand.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:33.860
I'd be okay without the light,

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:36.430
but you might fall and 
hurt yourself running.

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:39.690
Um, thank you for being concerned.

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:41.370
There.

00:17:44.920 --> 00:17:46.500
It's so pretty!

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:58.240
Hey, do you know any constellations?

00:17:58.240 --> 00:17:59.540
No, I don't.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:06.970
Is that Orion?

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:09.810
I thought Orion was a winter constellation.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:12.010
Then which one is Andromeda?

00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:13.750
I... have no idea.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:14.400
Oh!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.360
Do you see something you know?

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:19.200
Those stars form the ramen constellation.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:22.080
Then those over there must 
be the somen constellation!

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:29.160
Uh-oh...

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:31.740
We need to head back, 
or my mom will get mad.

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:34.410
I hate to leave, but let's 
come again sometime.

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:36.380
Okay. Ready to go, then?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.680
I'll light the path for us.

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:46.970
Hey! H-Hotaru, why'd you turn off the light?

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:49.150
Huh? I-I didn't turn it off!

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:50.390
It just went out!

00:18:50.390 --> 00:18:52.610
Let me see it! Flip the switch!

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:55.440
It's not working! I think the batteries died!

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:57.440
What?!

00:18:57.800 --> 00:18:59.530
Wh-What do we do?

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:02.160
Um... Um...

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.910
Um... Um...

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:06.910
What do we do?

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:09.500
H-Hotaru, are you crying?!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.410
Y-You can't cry over something like this!

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:12.930
Don't! You can't!

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:15.020
Sorry...

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:19.670
B-But it's so dark, I can't 
tell how to get home...

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:22.180
Yeah, but if we just look around us...

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:28.060
Nope, I can't tell.

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:38.900
Hotaru, this way!

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.030
I'm the older one here.

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:43.390
I'll get you home.

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:45.220
Don't let go of my hand.

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:48.280
S-Senpai... You can tell which way to go?

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:49.790
I can't tell either,

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.830
but staying here won't do us any good.

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:53.950
Okay...

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:56.860
Watch your step, Hotaru. Don't fall.

00:19:57.270 --> 00:19:58.220
Okay.

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:05.290
Let's see. We came from that way, right?

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:07.710
I-I think we came from this way...

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:10.870
I can't see anything but shadows of trees...

00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:12.910
Everything looks the same.

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:16.720
If we go the wrong way, 
we'll get even more lost.

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:18.820
W-We'll be fine.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:21.200
My eyes are starting to adjust.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.900
Just take a deep breath and calm 
down, and we'll find the wa—

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:27.710
S-Senpai?!

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:31.300
Wh-What was that? A bug?

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:33.450
My hand hit something...

00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:36.390
A lid from a plastic bottle?

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:38.420
Oh! It's the one I dropped!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:41.940
Does that mean we're going the right way?

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:43.490
Yeah, I think so.

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:44.260
Hotaru...

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.640
This way! Hurry!

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:53.680
Senpai! Look there!

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:54.850
I can see light!

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:02.490
We made it back!

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:03.950
Senpai...

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:11.500
Um, Senpai?

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:16.250
I was so relieved, my knees gave out...

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:24.300
Hotaru...

00:21:24.570 --> 00:21:27.760
You really don't have to do this for me.

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:29.380
It's all right.

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:32.020
I want to thank you for helping me.

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:36.220
Don't tell Natsumi my 
knees gave out, you hear?

00:21:36.220 --> 00:21:37.180
Okay.

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:39.520
Don't tell Renge, either.

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:42.030
Don't tell anyone, okay? Promise!

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:45.220
Okay. It'll be our little secret.

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:51.390
I polished my ruler up all nice and shiny!

00:21:51.390 --> 00:21:53.500
Pretty cool, but is there a point?

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:54.960
I'm sure to win with this!

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:57.280
Hotarun! Let's play knock-down-the-ruler!

00:21:57.280 --> 00:21:58.740
Oh, okay!

00:21:57.900 --> 00:21:59.520
I won't lose again!

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:01.170
It'll be different this time.

00:22:00.680 --> 00:22:02.060
I'm gonna win today!

00:22:02.060 --> 00:22:04.460
I won't lose!

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:16.460
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:21.550
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:42.030 --> 00:23:44.050
<i>Teach me English.</i>

00:23:44.530 --> 00:23:46.280
<i>Pizza, pizza, pizza, pizza...</i>

00:23:46.280 --> 00:23:47.440
<i>Don't be hasty!</i>

00:23:47.440 --> 00:23:48.430
<i>Cake?!</i>

00:23:48.880 --> 00:23:50.490
<i>Oh! Dekopon!</i>

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.490
<b>Episode 3</b>

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.490
<b>We Got Motivated
During the Holiday Break</b>

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
<b>Non Non Biyori
Repeat</b>

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
Photo: Reunin

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
Please Watch Again
